<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.8645.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty up vs dlr at 2.8645.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.8645 against the dollar, up from 2.8755 on Tuesday and at 1.8520 against the mark, down from 1.8500, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
